    "source": "rem Squarefree Numbers\nrem https://projecteuler.net/problem=193\nrem Count the squarefree numbers below\nrem two to the power Power\n\nuse numbers\nuse sequences\nuse io\nuse cli\n\noption Power integer = 50\n\nrem Q = sum of mu(d) floor(M / d^2) over\nrem d up to the root of M, the last n.\nrem A linear sieve gives mu on the way.\nM = 2 ** Power - 1\nTop = M isqrt\nMu = array shape (Top + 1) fill 2\nMu 1 = 1\nPr = array shape (Top // 8 + 100) fill 0\nCnt = 0\nAnswer = M\nfor I in 2 to Top\n  if Mu I equal 2\n    Pr Cnt = I\n    Cnt += 1\n    Mu I = 0 - 1\n  end\n  for J in 0 to Cnt - 1\n    V = I * Pr J\n    if V greater Top\n      break\n    end\n    if I mod Pr J equal 0\n      Mu V = 0\n      break\n    end\n    Mu V = 0 - Mu I\n  end\n  Answer += Mu I * (M // (I * I))\nend\nAnswer print\n"
